# Glossary

Canonical terms live in [.cursor/references/glossary.md](../references/glossary.md). Read it before inventing names.

When updating the glossary:

- One canonical term per concept; keep entries short (`### Term` blocks, no tables).
- Preserve existing entries unless the user approves changes; never silently rename.
- Merge duplicates; call out conflicts before overwriting.
- Format: definition sentence; optional `Aliases:`, `Avoid:`, `Notes:`.
